{
  "v": 1,
  "steps": [
    {
      "say": "A wind turbine is a tall tower with a housing at the top, called the nacelle, and three long blades on a hub at the front.",
      "actions": [
        {"op": "panel", "x": 370, "y": 100, "w": 560, "h": 780},
        {"op": "orbit", "az": 32, "el": 9, "dur": 0},
        {"op": "zoom", "to": 0.55, "dur": 0},
        {"op": "add", "shape": "group", "id": "turbine"},
        {"op": "move", "id": "turbine", "to": [0, -10.6, 0], "dur": 0},
        {"op": "add", "shape": "lathe", "id": "tower", "parent": "turbine", "profile": [[0, 0], [1.25, 0], [0.78, 11.95], [0, 11.95]], "sides": 40, "color": "#c4cdd8", "opacity": 0.55, "edges": false},
        {"op": "add", "shape": "group", "id": "head", "parent": "turbine", "pos": [0, 12.9, 0], "at": 0.3},
        {"op": "add", "shape": "box", "id": "nacelle", "parent": "head", "pos": [0, -0.45, 0], "size": [2.2, 1.0, 6.0], "color": "#9aa7b6", "bevel": 0.1, "at": 0.5},
        {"op": "add", "shape": "group", "id": "lid", "parent": "head", "pos": [-1.1, 0.05, 0], "at": 0.8},
        {"op": "add", "shape": "box", "id": "cover", "parent": "lid", "pos": [1.1, 0.55, 0], "size": [2.2, 1.1, 6.0], "color": "#e8edf2", "bevel": 0.25, "at": 0.8},
        {"op": "add", "shape": "group", "id": "rotor", "parent": "head", "pos": [0, 0.45, 3.4], "at": 1.2},
        {"op": "add", "shape": "sphere", "id": "hub", "parent": "rotor", "size": [1.7, 1.7, 1.7], "color": "#e8edf2", "at": 1.2},
        {"op": "add", "shape": "cone", "id": "spinner", "parent": "rotor", "pos": [0, 0, 0.95], "rot": [90, 0, 0], "size": [1.3, 1.4, 1.3], "color": "#e8edf2", "edges": false, "at": 1.3},
        {"op": "add", "shape": "extrude", "id": "blade", "parent": "rotor", "outline": [[-0.5, 0.8], [0.5, 0.8], [0.16, 7.6], [-0.1, 7.6], [-0.55, 2.4]], "depth": 0.14, "bevel": 0.04, "color": "#f6f8fb", "at": 1.6},
        {"op": "add", "shape": "array", "id": "blades", "of": "blade", "count": 3, "turn": [0, 0, 120], "at": 1.6},
        {"op": "pin", "id": "p-blade", "on": "blade", "point": [0, 5.2, 0], "text": "Blade", "at": 2.2},
        {"op": "pin", "id": "p-hub", "on": "hub", "text": "Hub", "at": 2.6},
        {"op": "pin", "id": "p-nac", "on": "nacelle", "text": "Nacelle", "at": 3.0},
        {"op": "pin", "id": "p-tower", "on": "tower", "point": [0, 6, 0], "text": "Tower", "at": 3.4}
      ]
    },
    {
      "say": "The wind pushes on the blades and turns the rotor slowly, only a few times a minute.",
      "actions": [
        {"op": "turn", "id": "rotor", "to": [0, 0, 240], "dur": 5},
        {"op": "orbit", "az": 50, "el": 10, "dur": 4}
      ]
    },
    {
      "say": "To see what the nacelle does, lift its cover.",
      "actions": [
        {"op": "clear", "target": "marks"},
        {"op": "focus", "id": "nacelle"},
        {"op": "zoom", "to": 1.0, "dur": 1.6},
        {"op": "style", "id": "rotor", "opacity": 0.16, "dur": 1.0},
        {"op": "orbit", "az": 24, "el": 30, "dur": 1.6},
        {"op": "turn", "id": "lid", "to": [0, 0, 115], "at": 0.6, "dur": 1.4}
      ]
    },
    {
      "say": "The blades are joined to a heavy main shaft. The shaft turns slowly but with great force.",
      "actions": [
        {"op": "add", "shape": "cylinder", "id": "shaft", "parent": "head", "pos": [0, 0.45, 2.0], "rot": [90, 0, 0], "size": [0.5, 3.0, 0.5], "material": "metal", "color": "#b9c0cc"},
        {"op": "add", "shape": "cylinder", "id": "bearing", "parent": "head", "pos": [0, 0.45, 1.3], "rot": [90, 0, 0], "size": [0.9, 0.5, 0.9], "material": "metal", "color": "#6f7a8c", "at": 0.3},
        {"op": "highlight", "id": "shaft", "color": "orange", "at": 0.4, "dur": 1.2},
        {"op": "pin", "id": "p-shaft", "on": "shaft", "text": "Main shaft", "at": 0.8}
      ]
    },
    {
      "say": "A gearbox raises the speed. Many turns of a fast shaft come out for each slow turn that goes in.",
      "actions": [
        {"op": "add", "shape": "box", "id": "gearbox", "parent": "head", "pos": [0, 0.4, 0.1], "size": [1.5, 1.3, 1.8], "material": "metal", "color": "#5d6e88", "bevel": 0.12},
        {"op": "add", "shape": "cylinder", "id": "fast", "parent": "head", "pos": [0, 0.45, -1.15], "rot": [90, 0, 0], "size": [0.28, 1.0, 0.28], "material": "metal", "color": "#d4d9e2", "at": 0.3},
        {"op": "add", "shape": "cylinder", "id": "brake", "parent": "head", "pos": [0, 0.45, -0.95], "rot": [90, 0, 0], "size": [0.95, 0.1, 0.95], "material": "metal", "color": "#c1493a", "at": 0.5},
        {"op": "highlight", "id": "gearbox", "color": "orange", "at": 0.5, "dur": 1.2},
        {"op": "pin", "id": "p-gear", "on": "gearbox", "text": "Gearbox", "at": 0.8},
        {"op": "pin", "id": "p-brake", "on": "brake", "text": "Brake", "at": 1.2}
      ]
    },
    {
      "say": "The fast shaft spins the generator, which turns that motion into electricity.",
      "actions": [
        {"op": "add", "shape": "cylinder", "id": "generator", "parent": "head", "pos": [0, 0.45, -2.25], "rot": [90, 0, 0], "size": [1.4, 1.6, 1.4], "color": "#e08a2c", "material": "metal"},
        {"op": "add", "shape": "cylinder", "id": "gen-ring", "parent": "head", "pos": [0, 0.45, -2.6], "rot": [90, 0, 0], "size": [1.5, 0.12, 1.5], "material": "metal", "color": "#4d5666", "at": 0.3},
        {"op": "highlight", "id": "generator", "color": "yellow", "at": 0.4, "dur": 1.4},
        {"op": "pin", "id": "p-gen", "on": "generator", "text": "Generator", "at": 0.8}
      ]
    },
    {
      "say": "A cable carries the electricity down through the tower to the grid.",
      "actions": [
        {"op": "add", "shape": "tube", "id": "wire-top", "parent": "head", "pts": [[0, 0.45, -3.0], [0, 0.0, -2.8], [0, -0.7, -1.0], [0, -0.95, 0]], "radius": 0.07, "color": "#ffd23f", "draw": 0},
        {"op": "add", "shape": "tube", "id": "wire-down", "parent": "turbine", "pts": [[0, 11.95, 0], [0, 8, 0], [0, 3, 0], [0.0, 0.2, 0.0]], "radius": 0.07, "color": "#ffd23f", "draw": 0},
        {"op": "reveal", "id": "wire-top", "to": 1, "dur": 0.8},
        {"op": "reveal", "id": "wire-down", "to": 1, "at": 0.8, "dur": 1.6},
        {"op": "style", "id": "rotor", "opacity": 1, "at": 0.8, "dur": 1.4},
        {"op": "zoom", "to": 0.55, "dur": 2.4},
        {"op": "orbit", "az": 36, "el": 9, "dur": 2.4},
        {"op": "focus", "dur": 1.0}
      ]
    },
    {
      "say": "When the wind changes direction, a ring of small motors at the top of the tower, the yaw drive, turns the whole nacelle to face it.",
      "actions": [
        {"op": "turn", "id": "lid", "to": [0, 0, 0], "dur": 1.0},
        {"op": "add", "shape": "torus", "id": "yaw-ring", "parent": "turbine", "pos": [0, 11.98, 0], "size": [2.5, 0.32, 2.5], "material": "metal", "color": "#d8aa48"},
        {"op": "add", "shape": "cylinder", "id": "yaw-motor", "parent": "head", "pos": [0.85, -1.15, 0.35], "size": [0.4, 0.5, 0.4], "color": "#3f6ae0", "material": "metal", "at": 0.3},
        {"op": "pin", "id": "p-yaw", "on": "yaw-ring", "text": "Yaw drive", "at": 0.9},
        {"op": "turn", "id": "head", "to": [0, -35, 0], "at": 1.2, "dur": 2.4},
        {"op": "card", "id": "sum", "x": 372, "y": 650, "w": 280, "title": "From wind to power", "rows": ["Blades turn the rotor", "Shaft and gearbox speed it up", "Generator makes electricity", "Yaw drive faces the wind"], "at": 2.0}
      ]
    }
  ]
}
